silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_01_foundational_thesis_and_anchors_sections_06_cheese_trap_immunity_concrete_anchor_cheese_probe a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.03_silmaril_federation.chapters.01_foundational_thesis_and_anchors.sections.06_cheese_trap_immunity.concrete_anchor.cheese_probe" .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_01_foundational_thesis_and_anchors_sections_06_cheese_trap_immunity_concrete_anchor_cheese_probe silm:hasLongDescription "The BareCatusStringMatchProbe is The CheeseProbe is the adversarial query 'catus' — a bare string that lexically overlaps with Felis catus / TSN 183798 (a source leg into D_Mittens) but not with Mittens the cat (the colimit apex). The probe is designed to route the federation engine to the wrong object." .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_01_foundational_thesis_and_anchors_sections_06_cheese_trap_immunity_concrete_anchor_wrong_object a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.03_silmaril_federation.chapters.01_foundational_thesis_and_anchors.sections.06_cheese_trap_immunity.concrete_anchor.wrong_object" .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_01_foundational_thesis_and_anchors_sections_06_cheese_trap_immunity_concrete_anchor_wrong_object silm:hasLongDescription "The FelisCatusTaxonRow_SourceLeg is The wrong object that the CheeseProbe routes to: Felis catus / TSN 183798. This is a source leg (a D_Mittens element at the taxonomy index position). It is classified-through from Mittens but is NOT Mittens. A federation engine returning this object as the apex has been cheese-trapped." .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_01_foundational_thesis_and_anchors_sections_06_cheese_trap_immunity_concrete_anchor_immunity_gate a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.03_silmaril_federation.chapters.01_foundational_thesis_and_anchors.sections.06_cheese_trap_immunity.concrete_anchor.immunity_gate" .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_01_foundational_thesis_and_anchors_sections_06_cheese_trap_immunity_concrete_anchor_immunity_gate silm:hasLongDescription "The SilMittensTaxonomyNegativeRegressionTable is The immunity gate is the SilMittensTaxonomyNegativeRegressionTable — a concrete negative regression table listing all known cheese probes and the typed paths that block them. It is the operational form of the Yoneda profile check. Any query must pass through this gate before routing." .
